---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="How WPM is calculated | TypeMeter" description="See the formula TypeMeter uses for WPM, raw WPM and accuracy.">
  <article class="page-shell narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Guide</p>
    <h1>How WPM is calculated</h1>
    <p>WPM = (correct characters / 5) / minutes elapsed. Raw WPM uses all typed characters, and accuracy is correct keystrokes divided by total keystrokes multiplied by 100.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
